            "jsdoc": {
              "purpose": "Loads the organization's company record in one call, with its readiness, its linked contacts and its current country, so the owner sees what is saved and what is still missing.",
              "input": "None. The company is the one of the logged-in owner's organization.",
              "processing": "Reads the company by id (read.byId) for the caller's organization; refuses with an authority error when the caller is not the company owner (onlyOwnerPreparesCompany) and returns a distinct not-found error when there is no company. Lists the linked contacts (listLinks). Resolves the saved countryCode in the module country list; when no country is saved it stays empty and is never defaulted (unknownCountryNeverDefaulted). Computes companyPrepared as true only when name, legal name, country, document type and number, at least one address and at least one linked contact are saved (companyPreparedRequiresAllData), and computes missingCompanyData as the items among those not yet saved (askOnlyMissingCompanyData). Derived fields are computed, never stored. Always returns the same company for the same organization (sameIdentityOnReturn).",
              "output": "The company record in its current saved state with id, version, identification, addresses, contacts summary, legal name, computed readiness and missing list, its linked contacts and the saved country when known."
            }
