            "jsdoc": {
              "purpose": "Saves the missing company data and creates or links the company contact, then returns the company in its new state.",
              "input": "id and version of the company for optimistic concurrency; name, legalName, docType, docId, countryCode and addresses: the company data the owner completes; contactName, contactCountryCode, contactType and contactValue: the company contact channel. Only the missing items are sent.",
              "processing": "Refuses with an authority error when the caller is not the company owner (onlyOwnerPreparesCompany), apart from validation errors and a missing company. Accepts only the items still missing (askOnlyMissingCompanyData). Checks countryCode and contactCountryCode exist as active countries of the module list (companyCountryFromModuleList, inactiveCountryNotOffered); an absent country stays missing and is never defaulted (unknownCountryNeverDefaulted, unknownCountryNoDefault). Updates the platform fields with the version (edit.platformFields). Locates an existing channel by type and value (locate.byContact), creates or attaches it only through the platform contact capability (companyContactLinkedWithoutDuplicate), checks it belongs to this company (companyContactBelongsToCompany) and links it with HasContact only when no active link exists (companyContactLinkNotDuplicated). If the contact step fails after the company was saved, the saved data is kept and reported so nothing is retyped (savedDataNotRetyped). Rereads the company and computes companyPrepared and missingCompanyData (companyPreparedRequiresAllData); derived fields are never stored.",
